    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Baseline coverage (xrdmon)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**From this collector:** demand (locate/open/redirect rates), sites touched (dest hosts), blame (redirects/host), xrootd client conns, cmsd peer active.\n\n**Not here (need probes / jobs / node_exporter):** unique LFNs, hops/open, client open success, TTFB, failure taxonomy, retries, post-redirect fails, CPU/FD, auth/TLS. Pair with Grafana node dash + synthetic AAA probes + OpenVerify ops board."
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": [
    "xrdmon",
    "xrootd",
    "cms",
    "aaa",
    "baseline"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "xrootd_instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(xrdmon_redir_total, xrootd_instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "xrdmon \u2014 CMS AAA Baseline",
  "uid": "xrdmon-cms-ops",
  "version": 2,
  "description": "AAA baseline: redirect demand, destinations, xrootd conns, cmsd peers. No SLO/TTFB (needs probes)."
}
